"""freaktown — come on then funny bones.

Usage:
  freaktown                        # interactive Black Room
  freaktown "gay dog, no sense of smell"   # one-shot premise
  freaktown --no-play "premise"    # generate + beats, skip audio

You direct. Free-tier AI writes. edge-tts speaks. Compositor owns timing.
"""

